WEBVTT

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:01.351
My family have lived in the same village

00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:04.601
on an island off the coast
of County Mayo in Ireland

00:07:04.625 --> 00:07:07.601
for the last 250 years.

00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:12.184
A real wake has got a real dead body.

00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:14.042
A dead one of us.

00:07:15.458 --> 00:07:17.351
Now they don't say much,

00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:20.625
but you sure can learn a lot
in their company.

00:07:21.708 --> 00:07:26.059
Every human being
who you have ever touched before,

00:07:26.083 --> 00:07:28.018
in love or anger,

00:07:28.042 --> 00:07:30.351
is a warm-blooded mammal.